rpi-splash-screen-support (1.0.3) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix cmdline.txt corruption when the file contains newlines or CRLF
    line endings; collapse newlines to spaces instead of deleting them,
    which previously glued kernel parameters into one invalid token
  * Back up cmdline.txt to cmdline.txt.bak before modifying
  * Quote the cmdline.txt filename throughout
  * Add missing runtime dependencies on initramfs-tools and file
  * Validate the image colour count (at most 224) using
    ImageMagick's identify when available; add imagemagick to Recommends
  * Write cmdline.txt in a single atomic operation instead of editing it
    in place
  * Preserve the original cmdline.txt backup across re-runs rather than
    overwriting it
  * Accept the splash image argument before or after options, and reject
    unknown options
  * Exit successfully (0) when --help is requested
  * Modernise packaging: use debhelper-compat (= 13), drop unused
    ${shlibs:Depends}, relax bash/sed version constraints, and bump
    Standards-Version to 4.7.0
  * Update package maintainer
  * Convert README to Markdown and document all command-line options in
    the man page

 -- Tom Dewey <tom.dewey@raspberrypi.com>  Wed, 03 Jun 2026 09:40:01 +0100

